{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "dd2b8f0dc647e34d368f4e21b8b70b512bd1a2aacf5e6ec9c4b82089539e633c", "ja": "ロックなホーリー・ナイト", "zh": "摇滚神圣之夜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0840913af75266c0cbd88d2058f09801a61032a8875c9a2a6aaea2ed17180c06", "ja": "クリスマス公演のテーマは『ロック』！\n気持ちを高めすぎたり、\n胸に紅い炎を燃やしたりする、\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "圣诞公演的主题是『摇滚』！\n这是偶像们情绪高涨、\n胸中燃起红色火焰的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "77d0f28ddee17e991324462ac9583a80ed9504b713934f1d76c8584efda95d8b", "ja": "（今日は『765クリスマスロックフェス』公演。\n開演を前に、アイドル達も気持ちを高めている！）", "zh": "（今天是『765圣诞摇滚节』公演。开演前，偶像们也都在不断提升自己的情绪！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "3df140142fb705de52f9195b316597242f6d869a2febf239977374343dcbfa2a", "ja": "どどど、どうしましょう……！\nどどど、どどど、どうしましょう……！", "zh": "怎么办怎么办……！\n怎怎怎、怎么办怎么办……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e5fae163061d36aeb4ca5c3e4ebebed9889c7f6193e6dec4ddf09c4f2e8a68ef", "ja": "……亜利沙は、気持ちを高め過ぎじゃないか？", "zh": "……亚利沙是不是兴奋过头了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "35ee335bc04a58d783795e2996eb7cbe26aa52a53b8a7bcaacc5ffa397bc58ad", "ja": "亜利沙ー、落ち着けってー。\nほら、もっと肩の力抜いて、リラックスリラックス♪", "zh": "亚利沙——都说了冷静点啦——\n来，把肩膀放松些，放松放松♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "1aea54c6a2f7284ed2637150879c97fd44451c4320ad7c697ce1d77f4d18c382", "ja": "わ、わかりました。ありさ、とりあえず皆さんの\n尊い衣装姿を見て、お、落ち着くことにします！", "zh": "我、我知道了。亚利沙先去看大家\n尊贵的演出服身姿，来，让自己冷静下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "a81a73154316fdb95070b65d16736eb20e4c6fb8336b00799ac8a4dca5504689", "ja": "ムフ……ムフフ……。", "zh": "呜呼……呜呼呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "b5586674c38e501ee3a0018c5b0aee406217bb1ff2754701e40284ecc93b20b6", "ja": "松田さん？　どうかしたの？", "zh": "松田同学？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "4a3d4ca30192fd5e98a0b16f761017f4ae20fd6e3c94238858a136ff45fca56e", "ja": "はああっ、ダメです！\nますますドキドキしてきましたー！", "zh": "哈啊啊，不行了！\n心跳越来越快了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "e5ae2148003336be8014b90ac5401c95599d6eefee5c11df61f93a393ced043a", "ja": "何してんだよ、もー！\n{$P$}、なんとかしてくれよ～。", "zh": "你在干什么啊，真是的！\n{$P$}，想想办法啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6ee197580c47e3a6a3174f0e72686b5270f52e3529ae939dcbc1baf0986bfb99", "ja": "うーん、いつにも増して高まってるな、亜利沙。\nいったい何が原因なんだ？", "zh": "嗯——亚利沙今天比平时还要兴奋啊。\n到底是什么原因呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "6cc2a8b6106112bf402211b04d937f463529d55349043bab049500337acb1ac5", "ja": "それが、歌う順番のことみたいで……。本番直前に\nなって、大トリの実感がわいてきたそうです。", "zh": "是因为演唱顺序的事……她说，直到正式演出前才真正意识到自己是压轴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "f60004b1a2ed425df15d939dc9e93470c35ae67a54b318906042e84aa759e2d0", "ja": "亜利沙ちゃんと昴ちゃん、今回のクリスマス公演の\n大トリだもんね♪　二人でトリトリだね！", "zh": "亚利莎和昴可是这次圣诞公演的压轴嘛♪ 两个人一起压轴，真是“压轴压轴”呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "56b48fd668c01c5f73b592b7596c1800de57da61e4a7bbb967a5b21784b55145", "ja": "ったく、ロックフェス公演で、\nまさか昴においしいところを持っていかれるとはな。", "zh": "真是的，没想到在摇滚音乐节公演上，居然被昴抢走了风头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "7c8c71273e0e099eb628f42595d81f68ace4c40ffcc09e82d271a9f8c46ce0cb", "ja": "へへっ、うらやましいだろー♪\nオレと亜利沙のロック、楽しみにしとけよ、ジュリア！", "zh": "嘿嘿，很羡慕吧～♪\n等着欣赏我和亚利沙的摇滚吧，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "8439094460cbf6ff58a087890e6b5965dd54f1f41e56f0f636d84193347cb326", "ja": "私も楽しみにしているわ。\nがんばって、永吉さん、……松田さん。", "zh": "我也很期待。加油，永吉……不，松田。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "1aad35e4e9847da7839af6bf4ac24cae4488e67aaa6e2c688c5deb753fe9ba75", "ja": "千早もいっぱいレッスン付き合ってくれてありがとな！\nマジで助かったよ～。", "zh": "千早，谢啦，陪我练了这么多次！\n真的帮大忙了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "f5493f9c1f214049051b54948d2b33ee395a2d2656905a497bece5e63f02eb9d", "ja": "私が手伝えたことなんて何も……。\n二人のステージは、二人の力で作り上げたものだから。", "zh": "我能帮上的忙根本算不了什么……。\n你们两个人的舞台，是靠你们两个人的力量打造出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "ff68e9deed869eb585d35c218e88fc536d7f64e4d45904b0e47b7c13726daf83", "ja": "昴さんと亜利沙さんのステージ、私もレッスンの時から\n見入っちゃってました。早く本番が見たいです！", "zh": "昴前辈和亚利沙前辈的舞台，我从排练的时候就看得入迷了。好想快点看到正式演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "f68ff99af9605a13f3e56dd4578cb363ed027023a3c989498d54885efd04ac3b", "ja": "二人の出番までは、私たちでめいっぱい\nモリモリに盛り上げちゃおうね！", "zh": "在两位登场之前，我们就尽情把气氛炒得热热闹闹的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "1436fc432c48fa2861a27231846e6a63fea28b0972bf66bc924467ac0c04474e", "ja": "ああ、ロックの手本ってヤツを見せてやる。\nそっちこそ楽しみにしとけよ、バカ昴♪", "zh": "啊，就让你见识一下什么叫摇滚的典范。\n你就好好期待吧，笨蛋昴♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "959e1b555001a16e2decd719041101f23dd2eca43c9ce9399d41b17000b077f1", "ja": "フーンだ。オレたちだって二人で\nすっげーがんばったもん、負けないって。な、亜利沙！", "zh": "哼，我们俩也一起拼命努力过的，才不会输。对吧，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "a2d90818910dbf76c8f606c963a9d7ede89cdf5e58b9eddaf6aeb569404c4f8d", "ja": "……はい、そうでした。ありさも昴くんと一緒に、\nロックのお仕事にぶつかっていって……", "zh": "……是的，确实如此。亚利沙也和昴君一起，向摇滚工作发起了挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "868e87ed4be5890a82697842db696349f6a3db8aed3c7bea4fcfdff11ac94127", "ja": "それで、たくさんの方に応援してもらえたんです。\n今日は、そういう気持ちにお応えする日でした！", "zh": "所以，我们得到了许多人的支持。\n今天就是回应大家这份心意的日子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "6fffde51a9e3b31b4e3d3e9a218f4d45ce23cebfeca3f2cc587a6c4517f9f8fa", "ja": "そうそう、みんなに見せつけてやろうぜ！\nオレたち二人の『CRIMSON LOVERS』をさ！", "zh": "对对，就让大家好好见识一下吧！\n见识一下我们两人的『CRIMSON LOVERS』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f1a0a3dfd35e20de194ef48b2ad0e43d8f992ecd23380d97c84450ebe75d585c", "ja": "よし、二人ともいい顔になったな。\nじゃあ、この勢いで……。", "zh": "好，两个人的状态都不错。\n那就趁着这股气势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "08d49f59673c7fc4289ba365e8cbd3029561febd0a7e87017016edcc43e2cb12", "ja": "いくぞ！　ロックなクリスマスの幕開けだ！", "zh": "上吧！摇滚圣诞节要开幕了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_118_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_118_fc_01_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
